er.\\ • New Starting Option: Choose from Zhang Jiao, Zhang Bao, or Zhang Liang to build your empire from scratch with the Yellow Turbans.\\ • Chen Dao: Heals while fighting, supporting nearby fast generals. • He Qi: Block bonuses granted by ally items are applied twic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:33:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030610","verified_at":"2026-10-22T01:34:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1846018067929041","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.5: There Can Only Be One Cao Cao","summary":"\\Character cards fully redesigned: more refined card frames, plus a striking \"break-the-frame\" effect where characters pop out of their cards.Battles now use a perspective view, with more location art for a more immersive experience.\\ After many versions of testing, I found two problems with duplicate cards:Broken immersion: Two Cao Caos in the same battle just doesn't feel right.Less strategy: Duplicate effects stack mindlessly, which also makes PvP easy to unbalance.Starting with v1.5, duplica","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T09:58:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929041","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1844751498228060","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.4｜Online Battle Beta Now Live — Join the Early Test","summary":"【Ranked Battles】Added a test version of asynchronous online battles. Challenge teams left by other players and view their ranks, battle records, and team compositions.Access is currently limited through a test entry code. Free test codes are available in our Discord community.【System】Optimized visual effects resources to resolve battle lag and improve overall combat performance.Integrated the Character Codex. Selected characters are now displayed directly on the right side for easier team manage","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T20:47:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228060","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1844751498218774","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.3.923 | Supply & Colored Action Frames, Four Lesser-Known Characters Debu","summary":"\\Colored Action Frame: The Attack Value frame at the bottom-left of character cards is now the Action Value frame. The number indicates the effect value of the character's primary action. Different colors are used to distinguish action types (e.g., Attack, Heal, Supply, Burn), helping players quickly grasp character roles.Added an option in Settings to skip the gacha/draw animation.Added a one-click team screenshot feature upon clearing Day 10 for easy sharing.Accidental Merge Prevention: A conf","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T15:20:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1844115010502966","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.3 | Total UI Overhaul & Endless Mode Unlocked","summary":"\\ While the core gameplay remains unchanged, we've significantly upgraded the art for every interactive scene to create a much more immersive experience. Since there are too many visual updates to easily describe in text, we highly encourage you to boot up the game and see the changes for yourself!\\ \"Event Enhancements\" have been changed to \"Enhancement Essences.\" Once obtained, you can now keep them in your inventory and distribute them to eligible characters later.\\ After completing the 10-day","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T03:05:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502966","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1842212951313755","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.2.901 | Custom Officer Pool — 36 Hidden Officers Await!","summary":"【SYSTEM】The Officer Codex has received a major overhaul! Choose 15 officers from each of the four factions to create your own custom officer pool.【NEW STARTING MODE】Added Free Formation, giving experienced players more freedom to build unique starting lineups.【NEW LOCATION】Training Grounds: Challenge mysterious teams. Win to recruit an officer of your choice—along with the item they have equipped!【NEW OFFICERS】Added 36 advanced officers. Complete their individual run requirements to unlock them ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T15:16:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1842212951295754","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.1.826 | Matchless Might","summary":"【SYSTEM】Past Challenge now includes 45 unique developer-made teams.Improved the appearance and layout of the Officer Codex.Fixed several hidden issues affecting Chance Guard, Stun Pursuit, Barricades, and more.Various UI and VFX improvements.【NEW CHARACTERS】New arrivals: Huang Yueying, Yu Jin, and Lu Su.Character reworks: Zhang Fei, Yue Jin, Zhou Tai, Xu Shu, Ling Tong, Gao Shun, Ma Chao, and Ma Dai.【BALANCE CHANGES】Cao Pi: Thunder Slash now scales with his ATK.Huaman: No longer loses ATK or HP ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T04:28:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1841579228671682","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0.822 | New Location Events and Character Reworks","summary":"\\Updated Past Challenge matchmaking so the same team will no longer appear more than once during a single run.After your first defeat, Remnant Regroup now offers a choice of three cards from all factions, making the options more adaptable to your current team.\\Added a brand-new event to every location.\\Xu ShuGuo JiaLu Xun\\Cao RenHu Che'erHuang ZhongJia XuYue JinXu Chu\\Cai Wenji: Now selects a random target.Bao Sanniang: Cooldown reduced from 3.5 to 3.3 seconds.Zhang Jiao: Cooldown reduced from 7","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T15:57:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5024380-1841579228663922","game_id":"steam-5024380","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.0.820 | New Mode: \"Past Challenge\"","summary":"NEW MODE: PAST CHALLENGESave your strongest teams locally, then challenge them again and again to discover the ultimate strategy!NEW FEATURESAdded right-click officer lookup: See the locations where each officer is more likely to appear.Added an in-game screenshot feature: Click the camera icon to save the current game screen.MECHANICS & CONTENT UPDATESReworked Poison and Regen: Both now trigger ever